WEBVTT

00:03.086 --> 00:06.046
[JAEGERIST 83A]
Oliver! You okay? I got you!

00:19.106 --> 00:23.026
[HANGE] That's it.
The last of our pursuers, Levi.

00:30.446 --> 00:32.576
[HANGE]
Everyone got turned into Titans.

00:32.656 --> 00:35.576
You're the only one
who survived.

00:35.656 --> 00:37.166
Likely for the same
reason you lived

00:37.246 --> 00:39.706
through a Thunder Spear blast
at point-blank range.

00:39.786 --> 00:42.706
You Ackermanns aren't
built like the rest of us.

00:57.266 --> 01:00.266
[HANGE] We're still here,
but what do we do?

01:00.356 --> 01:03.646
There's no way the two of us
can stop Zeke by ourselves.

01:03.726 --> 01:06.606
It's up to Armin and
Commander Pyxis now.

01:08.066 --> 01:11.986
Eren might be planning to turn
on Zeke and hijack the Founder.

01:12.076 --> 01:14.196
But thanks to
Zeke's tainted wine,

01:14.286 --> 01:16.036
the Jaegerists would
retain control of the island,

01:16.116 --> 01:17.366
so even if Eren wins,

01:17.456 --> 01:20.416
we'll be on the run
for the rest of our lives.

01:22.206 --> 01:25.126
That's it. Guess it's
really my turn, huh.

01:25.206 --> 01:27.006
Ever since this started,
I've just been trying

01:27.086 --> 01:29.426
to do what I thought was right.

01:30.506 --> 01:32.136
And after everything
that's happened,

01:32.216 --> 01:34.676
it could land me in a cell.

01:34.766 --> 01:36.466
Or maybe you and I
can just camp out here

01:36.556 --> 01:38.226
in the sticks forever.

01:38.306 --> 01:40.346
Right, Levi?

01:44.356 --> 01:46.396
[Gasps] He wouldn't.

01:46.476 --> 01:47.986
The whole world?

01:48.066 --> 01:51.026
How can he not see that-- Levi!

01:52.656 --> 01:54.076
[LEVI]
What happened?

01:54.156 --> 01:56.746
Where is that
hairy sack of shit?

01:56.826 --> 01:58.536
[HANGE]
No need to get up.

01:58.616 --> 02:00.406
Zeke's long gone,
the Jaegerists found him

02:00.496 --> 02:02.036
after hearing the explosion.

02:02.126 --> 02:04.206
They took off for
Shiganshina half a day ago.

02:04.286 --> 02:07.086
What happened?
How did he break free?

02:07.166 --> 02:10.376
It was my fault.
I screwed up.

02:10.466 --> 02:11.426
Had him rigged to blow

02:11.506 --> 02:13.176
if he tried to
break his restraints.

02:13.256 --> 02:15.806
I didn't think he'd do it.

02:15.886 --> 02:18.346
I was wrong and he got away.

02:18.426 --> 02:20.516
Worrying about it
won't help us now.

02:20.596 --> 02:21.896
We can't do anything but--

02:21.976 --> 02:26.356
[LEVI] Run and hide?
If we do, what'll that get us?

02:26.436 --> 02:29.816
[Gasp] Fair question.
You must have been lying there

02:29.896 --> 02:32.156
listening to me talk
to myself for a while.

02:32.236 --> 02:35.566
What's with your
little project, there?

02:35.656 --> 02:37.026
That for me?

02:37.116 --> 02:39.366
Gonna pull me around
with a horse?

02:39.446 --> 02:41.326
Yeah, that sounds like you.

02:41.406 --> 02:42.416
There's no way
in hell you're gonna

02:42.496 --> 02:44.376
be staying out of the action.

02:44.456 --> 02:46.706
That's right, you know
me far too well.

02:46.786 --> 02:48.496
Can't help myself.

02:50.666 --> 02:54.846
[LEVI] I'm after one thing now.
My goal is to take Zeke's head.

02:54.926 --> 02:57.676
Theo Magath. Pieck Finger.

02:57.756 --> 03:00.136
Looks like our
interests are aligned.

03:07.396 --> 03:09.856
[MAGATH] Levi Ackermann,
the man who went

03:09.936 --> 03:13.356
toe-to-toe with one of
the Nine all on his own.

03:13.446 --> 03:15.696
Not sure how you plan on
dodging a bullet,

03:15.776 --> 03:17.736
given the shape you're in.

03:17.826 --> 03:19.996
I couldn't dodge
a punch right now,

03:20.076 --> 03:22.036
and yet, I still
chose to come here

03:22.116 --> 03:24.786
and put myself at your mercy.

03:24.876 --> 03:29.376
Shoot me, or hear me out.
The choice is yours.

03:34.586 --> 03:37.506
Well, hell. I can always
shoot you later.

03:37.596 --> 03:39.676
If you two are
planning to kill Zeke,

03:39.756 --> 03:41.886
does that mean you already
know where to find him?

03:41.966 --> 03:43.306
He'll be with the Founder.

03:43.386 --> 03:44.806
The fact that this is
happening indicates

03:44.896 --> 03:47.146
Zeke's royal blood
is in contact with Eren,

03:47.226 --> 03:50.276
or rather, the Founding Titan,
I should say.

03:50.356 --> 03:51.726
I never would've guessed
that you would be

03:51.816 --> 03:54.316
this knowledgeable
about Titans, Hange.

03:54.396 --> 03:56.566
You know more
than Marley's guys.

03:56.656 --> 03:59.616
I don't suppose you've laid eyes
on the Founding Titan yourself?

03:59.696 --> 04:01.536
I know that the thing
is humongous.

04:01.616 --> 04:03.116
So big that it seems
like nothing would

04:03.196 --> 04:04.826
ever be able to slow it down.

04:04.916 --> 04:06.206
But we've gotta try.

04:06.286 --> 04:08.956
Let's give ourselves
the best possible chance.

04:09.036 --> 04:12.876
Our only option now is to
join forces. So what do you say?

04:13.006 --> 04:17.966
♪ Opening Song ♪

06:25.756 --> 06:26.756
[CONNY]
I still don't know how I'll

06:26.846 --> 06:29.516
actually get Mom to eat Falco.

06:29.596 --> 06:31.726
Just force him into her mouth?

06:32.896 --> 06:34.306
[CONNY] But if he gets
hurt in the process

06:34.396 --> 06:38.066
and figures out that he can
turn Titan, then that's it.

06:38.146 --> 06:40.106
I can't screw it up.

06:40.186 --> 06:43.776
I need to come up with
a plan. A real one.

06:45.946 --> 06:48.116
[CONNY]
He's such a good kid.

06:48.196 --> 06:49.366
He's camping out here
in the woods

06:49.446 --> 06:51.786
without a single complaint,

06:51.866 --> 06:54.286
and he has every
reason to doubt me.

06:56.796 --> 07:00.376
[CONNY]
But he trusts me with his life.

07:01.626 --> 07:03.176
Dammit!

07:03.256 --> 07:08.256
Sasha. Would you have understood
what I'm about to do?

07:15.436 --> 07:18.976
[FALCO] Sir? I thought you were
taking me to a hospital,

07:19.066 --> 07:21.106
but this is an
abandoned village.

07:21.186 --> 07:24.316
[CONNY] Right. There's just
something interesting here.

07:24.406 --> 07:26.446
Thought you might
like to see it.

07:28.036 --> 07:30.746
[FALCO]
Is this Ragako Village?

07:30.826 --> 07:31.946
[CONNY gasps]

07:33.416 --> 07:36.626
You've heard of it before?
How'd you know?

07:36.706 --> 07:38.376
'Cause you mentioned it.

07:38.456 --> 07:42.506
I accidentally heard you
talking to yourself last night.

07:42.586 --> 07:44.296
And that name, "Sasha."

07:44.376 --> 07:46.676
You were talking about
one of the other soldiers.

07:46.756 --> 07:49.006
She was the one
Gabi shot, right?

07:49.096 --> 07:52.556
The whole time,
you've known exactly who I was,

07:52.636 --> 07:56.146
yet you acted like you didn't
'til you'd gotten me out here.

07:56.226 --> 07:58.146
Why do all this?

07:58.226 --> 08:00.266
Why would you go to
that much effort?

08:00.356 --> 08:01.276
For revenge?

08:01.356 --> 08:02.526
Hardly.

08:02.606 --> 08:05.026
Soldiers get killed
in the heat of battle.

08:05.106 --> 08:06.566
I know that.

08:11.366 --> 08:14.206
[Gasps]

08:20.126 --> 08:22.376
[CONNY]
It's been lying here for years.

08:22.456 --> 08:24.006
Never even budged.

08:24.086 --> 08:26.046
It's not a threat to us.

08:28.136 --> 08:31.466
Why is it here?
And why show me?

08:31.556 --> 08:32.806
What are you gonna
do with me now?

08:32.886 --> 08:33.926
[CONNY gasps]

08:47.356 --> 08:49.066
Yeah, guess I never
mentioned that.

08:49.156 --> 08:50.866
Think you could help me
brush its teeth?

08:50.946 --> 08:54.406
It's a pretty rare opportunity.
Wouldn't wanna pass it up.

08:58.286 --> 08:59.456
Huh?

08:59.536 --> 09:01.456
But first, we're gonna
have to climb up onto

09:01.546 --> 09:03.206
that rafter for a better angle.

09:03.296 --> 09:04.456
The ladder is solid
and I'm not gonna

09:04.546 --> 09:06.006
let you fall or anything.

09:06.086 --> 09:08.756
So. Let's get to it!

09:09.676 --> 09:11.046
Sounds good.

09:11.136 --> 09:13.466
[GABI]
Falco! Get away from him now!

09:13.556 --> 09:14.346
Gabi?

09:14.426 --> 09:15.386
He brought you out here because

09:15.466 --> 09:17.636
he wants to feed you
to that Titan!

09:17.726 --> 09:19.556
Please stop.
Don't do it, Conny!

09:19.646 --> 09:22.266
Get back! Don't come any closer!

09:22.356 --> 09:23.316
[Gasps]

09:25.066 --> 09:26.356
[ARMIN]
Conny!

09:26.436 --> 09:28.566
Just shut up!
I don't wanna hear it!

09:28.656 --> 09:29.986
Don't even bother talking to me,

09:30.066 --> 09:32.116
'cause there's no way
I'm gonna listen!

09:32.196 --> 09:34.366
You're gonna say I should
give up on saving my Mom.

09:34.446 --> 09:36.576
'Cause his life is
more important than hers.

09:36.656 --> 09:38.366
And you're smart,
so you might be right.

09:38.456 --> 09:41.246
But I'm way too much
of an idiot to care!

09:41.326 --> 09:44.456
[GABI] Falco, you have to use
the power of the Jaw Titan!

09:44.546 --> 09:47.126
Use the power of the Jaw? What?

09:47.206 --> 09:49.426
But what about Mr. Galliard?

09:51.386 --> 09:55.056
Not Falco. He's innocent!
Let him go!

09:58.726 --> 10:01.726
Gabi, please forgive
Conny for this, okay?

10:01.806 --> 10:02.896
[Gasps]

10:09.736 --> 10:12.816
Hey! Didn't you hear me
say to stay back?

10:22.666 --> 10:24.336
[Gasps]

10:24.416 --> 10:27.336
[CONNY] Wait. What are you
doing up there?

10:28.626 --> 10:30.756
Hey! Answer the
damn question, Armin!

10:30.836 --> 10:34.346
Why? You just told me that
you weren't gonna listen!

10:34.426 --> 10:35.926
So I won't answer.

10:36.006 --> 10:38.516
I'll just let my actions
speak instead.

11:02.456 --> 11:04.036
Oh, Colt.

11:05.536 --> 11:09.626
[CONNY] If I hadn't saved you,
what were you gonna do?

11:09.706 --> 11:11.796
[ARMIN] The same thing
you were gonna do.

11:11.876 --> 11:14.046
Make your mom human again.

11:14.136 --> 11:18.096
You also would've made her into
the inheritor of the Colossal.

11:18.176 --> 11:20.926
There would've been nothing
ahead of her but more pain.

11:21.016 --> 11:23.896
It shouldn't take a genius
to figure that much out.

11:25.516 --> 11:27.566
[CONNY]
When she saw me off,

11:27.646 --> 11:31.236
she told me to become a great
soldier--everyone's protector.

11:31.316 --> 11:33.446
But right in front of her eyes,

11:33.526 --> 11:37.696
my friend almost died trying to
stop me from murdering a kid.

11:37.776 --> 11:41.946
Guess that's the kind of soldier
I turned out to be. Pathetic.

11:43.536 --> 11:45.326
I'm not any better.

11:45.416 --> 11:48.666
I'll never come close to
filling the Commander's shoes.

11:53.296 --> 11:56.586
Look, Armin.
I wanna try and become

11:56.676 --> 11:59.506
the kind of soldier
my mom would be proud of.

12:03.186 --> 12:04.646
So let's do it.

12:04.726 --> 12:07.806
There's a whole world of people
that need saving right now.

12:18.946 --> 12:20.156
[MIKASA]
There you are.

12:20.236 --> 12:22.326
[LOUISE]
I'm glad to see you.

12:23.656 --> 12:24.666
Have you been looking because

12:24.746 --> 12:26.956
you were worried
I didn't make it?

12:27.036 --> 12:30.546
Or is it because you
wanted your scarf back?

12:30.626 --> 12:32.666
[MIKASA]
I was pretty sure you'd have it.

12:32.756 --> 12:34.336
I'm sorry for taking it.

12:34.416 --> 12:36.546
I just... I felt like
maybe it could

12:36.636 --> 12:38.886
bring me a bit closer to you.

12:41.136 --> 12:44.346
There's shrapnel from a Thunder
Spear deep in my stomach.

12:44.426 --> 12:46.556
The doctors can't get it out.

12:46.646 --> 12:47.646
For one hundred years,

12:47.726 --> 12:49.646
we've been imprisoned
on this island,

12:49.726 --> 12:52.726
but Eren's giving our people
a world where we can be free.

12:52.816 --> 12:54.566
I wish I could see it.

12:56.906 --> 12:58.446
We spoke before,

12:58.526 --> 13:01.536
just a short conversation
when I was bringing his food.

13:01.616 --> 13:03.866
We were talking about you.

13:05.286 --> 13:06.866
[LOUISE]
When the scarf came up,

13:06.956 --> 13:09.626
he said he wanted
to throw it out.

13:11.996 --> 13:14.586
And so, if it was just
gonna get tossed,

13:14.666 --> 13:16.376
I figured it wouldn't
hurt anything if I--

13:16.466 --> 13:17.926
[MIKASA]
Give it back.

13:23.596 --> 13:27.346
[LOUISE] I became a soldier
because I admired you.

13:30.396 --> 13:33.606
And I'll die with no regrets.

13:35.276 --> 13:37.356
I pledged my heart and soul,
just like you.

13:37.446 --> 13:39.736
I followed in your footsteps
as best I could

13:39.816 --> 13:42.116
and gave my life to the cause.

13:47.826 --> 13:51.626
[PARADIS MAN 83A] The last Wall
Titans are finally marching off.

13:51.706 --> 13:53.296
[PARADIS MAN 83B]
Yeah. It'll be nice to have

13:53.376 --> 13:55.376
a little bit of quiet again.

13:55.456 --> 13:57.256
[PARADIS MAN 83A]
I don't mind the rumbling.

13:57.336 --> 14:00.506
To me, it sounds like
the bells of freedom.

14:03.256 --> 14:06.216
[FLOCH] For the past century,
our Eldian Empire has

14:06.306 --> 14:09.766
suffered persecution at the
hands of the outside world.

14:09.846 --> 14:12.096
That ends now!

14:12.186 --> 14:14.686
At this moment,
we're finally free!

14:14.776 --> 14:16.106
Thanks to our liberator, Eren,

14:16.186 --> 14:18.486
and all the efforts of
my fellow Jaegerists,

14:18.566 --> 14:20.236
our people have
achieved victory!

14:20.316 --> 14:23.366
[JAEGERISTS cheer]

14:23.446 --> 14:25.156
So. What are you thinking?

14:25.236 --> 14:27.406
You know the Jaegerists have
a place for you at the top.

14:27.496 --> 14:29.746
Are you gonna join them
and start calling the shots?

14:29.826 --> 14:31.246
Think I'll pass on that.

14:31.326 --> 14:32.536
Guess whatever
you're worried about

14:32.626 --> 14:34.376
doesn't really bother Jean.

14:34.456 --> 14:35.996
Our hearts and souls,
to the cause!

14:36.086 --> 14:37.756
[JAEGERISTS] Our hearts
and souls, to the cause!

14:37.836 --> 14:39.336
[FLOCH] Our hearts and souls,
to the cause!

14:39.416 --> 14:41.176
[JAEGERISTS] Our hearts
and souls, to the cause!

14:41.256 --> 14:43.136
[FLOCH] Our hearts and souls,
to the cause!

14:43.216 --> 14:45.216
[PARADIS MEN] Our hearts
and souls, to the cause!

14:45.306 --> 14:47.556
[PARADIS MAN 83D]
Glory to the Jaegerists!

14:47.636 --> 14:49.556
[PARADIS MAN 83E] Our hearts
and souls, to the cause!

14:49.636 --> 14:52.516
[PARADIS MAN 83F]
To Eren, liberator of Eldia!

14:52.596 --> 14:55.516
I think we should go and
get Reiner as soon as possible.

14:55.606 --> 14:57.686
He shouldn't even be waking up
for a few more days,

14:57.776 --> 14:58.936
so there's no hurry.

14:59.026 --> 15:01.656
Are we sure taking this
detour was a good idea?

15:01.736 --> 15:04.366
We were gonna have to
eat eventually, right?

15:05.696 --> 15:07.656
[CONNY]
So, you think it's true, Armin?

15:07.736 --> 15:10.616
[ARMIN] Mm-hm. If all
Titan hardening came undone

15:10.706 --> 15:12.616
when the walls fell,
then there's no reason to think

15:12.706 --> 15:13.456
that wouldn't include Annie's--

15:13.536 --> 15:15.036
[ANNIE coughs]

15:16.416 --> 15:18.256
[ARMIN]
Wha-- Annie?

15:18.336 --> 15:20.456
[ALL gasp]

15:24.006 --> 15:27.756
[CONNY laughs]
Look at that.

15:27.846 --> 15:32.056
Annie was stuffing
her face with pie! [Laughs]

15:32.136 --> 15:33.686
Come on, Conny, that's enough.

15:33.766 --> 15:35.556
She had half that
slice in her mouth!

15:35.646 --> 15:38.526
Yeah, but she hasn't had
a bite in four years!

15:38.606 --> 15:42.276
[HITCH] Sorry! The line
for pie was ridiculous.

15:42.356 --> 15:44.486
Right, never mind, then.

15:46.156 --> 15:47.616
[ANNIE]
Dear Hitch.

15:47.696 --> 15:50.196
I happened across
Armin and Conny,

15:50.286 --> 15:53.326
and I decided it was
best if I joined them.

15:53.416 --> 15:57.496
So, I'm off.
Sorry for all the trouble.

15:57.586 --> 16:01.206
Thank you for keeping me company
these past four years.

16:01.296 --> 16:05.966
Goodbye. Sincerely,
your gloomy roommate.

16:14.306 --> 16:15.726
Jeez, Annie.

16:15.806 --> 16:19.016
You expect me to eat
this whole pie by myself?

16:20.816 --> 16:24.446
[FLOCH] Comrades of the Empire,
thank you for joining me!

16:24.526 --> 16:26.196
We are gathered here
for the execution

16:26.276 --> 16:28.026
of these two Volunteers.

16:28.116 --> 16:30.866
They've both admitted to
opposing the Eldian Empire!

16:30.946 --> 16:33.496
And in removing these disloyal
elements from our midst,

16:33.576 --> 16:34.956
we're taking our
first step towards

16:35.036 --> 16:37.746
realizing Eren's dream
of world domination--

16:37.826 --> 16:41.376
by declaring Eldia's
uncontested rule over Paradis!

16:41.456 --> 16:45.376
[JAEGERISTS cheer]

16:45.466 --> 16:47.336
[FLOCH]
This criminal is Yelena.

16:47.426 --> 16:49.806
She took up arms
and opposed Marley.

16:49.886 --> 16:52.516
She lived among us
and fought at our side,

16:52.596 --> 16:54.726
but she did not fight for us!

16:54.806 --> 16:58.146
Her loyalty was to Zeke,
and Zeke alone!

16:58.226 --> 17:00.476
She sought to turn the
Founder's power against us

17:00.566 --> 17:02.526
and wipe the Eldian
people from the earth!

17:02.606 --> 17:05.486
She was nothing but another
filthy Marleyan from the start!

17:05.566 --> 17:07.906
Thankfully, Eren was
able to defeat Zeke

17:07.986 --> 17:10.736
and put an end to
his traitorous plot.

17:10.826 --> 17:13.246
Nonetheless, this criminal
served as Zeke's puppet

17:13.326 --> 17:14.656
every step of the way!

17:14.746 --> 17:15.706
[JAEGERIST 83D]
Marleyan whore!

17:15.786 --> 17:18.166
[JAEGERIST 83E]
Send her to hell!

17:18.246 --> 17:19.496
Well, Yelena?

17:19.576 --> 17:22.206
Any last words
you'd like to share?

17:22.296 --> 17:24.046
[YELENA]
Would you get it over with?

17:24.126 --> 17:28.756
[JAEGERISTS yelling]

17:28.836 --> 17:31.466
Kill her now! Do it!
Put her down!

17:31.556 --> 17:36.926
[JAEGERISTS] Shoot her!
Shoot her! Shoot her! Shoot her!

17:37.016 --> 17:38.306
It isn't time yet!

17:38.386 --> 17:43.606
[JAEGERISTS chattering]

17:43.686 --> 17:45.896
[FLOCH]
This criminal is Onyankopon.

17:45.986 --> 17:48.816
He used to be
a steadfast ally of Eldia.

17:48.896 --> 17:51.526
And he had no knowledge of
Zeke's euthanization plan.

17:51.616 --> 17:54.196
That said, when offered
the privilege of citizenship

17:54.286 --> 17:55.656
in the reborn Eldian Empire,

17:55.746 --> 17:57.616
he claimed he would rather die!

17:57.706 --> 17:59.666
It's still not too late
for you to reconsider.

17:59.746 --> 18:02.956
[Laughs]

18:03.046 --> 18:04.496
I joined up with
the Volunteers because

18:04.586 --> 18:07.626
I wanted to liberate my own
homeland from Marleyan rule.

18:07.716 --> 18:10.546
And yes, I wanted to help
your people as well!

18:10.636 --> 18:13.636
But how are you repaying my help
now that you've won?

18:13.716 --> 18:15.966
My whole country's
gonna be destroyed.

18:16.056 --> 18:19.726
Eren's gonna kill
everybody I care for, right?

18:19.806 --> 18:21.686
And I get to live out
my life here with your

18:21.766 --> 18:26.316
sad little gang of
xenophobic shitheads? [Laughs]

18:26.396 --> 18:28.196
If living on means
sucking up to you guys,

18:28.276 --> 18:29.986
I'm more than ready to die!

18:30.066 --> 18:32.776
Everybody on this island had
their lives turned upside down

18:32.866 --> 18:35.826
by sudden acts of
indiscriminate mass murder!

18:35.906 --> 18:39.826
So how is it not a single
one of you understands?

18:39.906 --> 18:42.956
Talk some sense
into 'em, Jean! Please!

18:44.246 --> 18:45.126
[Gasps]

18:45.206 --> 18:50.216
[Gunshots]

18:54.716 --> 18:56.056
[Gasps]

18:57.716 --> 18:59.176
[Gasps]

18:59.266 --> 19:00.426
Hey!

19:02.016 --> 19:04.686
Sorry about that.
It pulled right.

19:04.766 --> 19:05.936
What do you mean?

19:06.016 --> 19:08.316
Don't screw with me, Jean.

19:08.396 --> 19:09.896
[JAEGERISTS gasp]

19:09.986 --> 19:11.146
[BOTH gasp]

19:11.236 --> 19:12.526
[JEAN]
Floch!

19:22.156 --> 19:23.496
[JAEGERIST 83N]
That was the Cart Titan!

19:23.576 --> 19:24.376
[JAEGERIST 83O]
They got away!

19:24.456 --> 19:25.246
[JAEGERIST 83P]
It ate Jean!

19:25.326 --> 19:26.666
[JAEGERIST 83Q]
And Yelena!

19:26.746 --> 19:31.466
Hey. Someone find Mikasa!
She can take out the Cart.

19:31.546 --> 19:34.836
Hold on. Was she even here?

19:34.926 --> 19:37.136
Where's Mikasa?

19:37.216 --> 19:38.676
You heard that, right?

19:38.766 --> 19:41.636
He said he'd signal us
with four gunshots.

19:41.726 --> 19:44.146
Jean must be ready to
kick off the next phase.

19:44.226 --> 19:45.646
We grabbed enough
food and munitions

19:45.726 --> 19:47.106
to keep us going for a while.

19:47.186 --> 19:49.026
All eyes should be fixed on
the other side of the fort

19:49.106 --> 19:50.486
for at least a few minutes.

19:50.566 --> 19:51.946
Let's roll out!

20:03.036 --> 20:04.616
[ANNIE]
Somebody spotted us!

20:07.126 --> 20:08.796
What are we gonna do now, Armin?

20:08.876 --> 20:10.546
No choice but to keep moving.

20:10.626 --> 20:12.416
Faster, Mikasa!

20:21.096 --> 20:24.386
[JEAN retching]

20:24.476 --> 20:27.936
That's the last damn time
I get in a Titan's mouth.

20:28.016 --> 20:29.186
[HANGE] The Cart's
supposed to be able to

20:29.266 --> 20:31.856
stay in Titan form for
months at a time, right?

20:31.936 --> 20:33.816
Don't you ever brush your teeth?

20:33.896 --> 20:37.196
You shouldn't ask such things.
I'm a lady, remember?

20:37.276 --> 20:40.576
Now you're on our side?
When'd you join up with Marley?

20:40.656 --> 20:42.076
It was last night.

20:42.156 --> 20:44.496
But why'd you do it?
I don't get it.

20:44.576 --> 20:46.286
You could have had
a life of luxury.

20:46.366 --> 20:49.536
The Jaegerists would have given
you anything you asked them for.

20:51.836 --> 20:54.166
You're right. If I had
any sense at all,

20:54.256 --> 20:57.586
I'd be sitting in my room with
my ears plugged right now.

20:57.676 --> 21:01.306
But no. Then that
burning pile of bones

21:01.386 --> 21:04.426
would've haunted me
for the rest of my life.

21:04.516 --> 21:08.846
Jean. I have no idea
what you're talking about,

21:08.936 --> 21:10.856
but you have my thanks.

21:10.936 --> 21:13.356
Wash up, you smell
like Titan breath.

21:14.816 --> 21:17.816
Why me? After everything.

21:17.906 --> 21:19.486
[HANGE] We needed to
borrow the Cart's power

21:19.566 --> 21:20.986
to make this plan work.

21:21.076 --> 21:22.826
You were just part of the deal.

21:23.696 --> 21:26.746
For some reason, they insisted
that we take you alive.

21:33.626 --> 21:34.626
[Groans]

21:34.716 --> 21:36.216
[ANNIE]
Wake up.

21:42.256 --> 21:43.636
Annie?

21:46.476 --> 21:48.016
[GABI]
Whoa, take it easy, Reiner!

21:48.096 --> 21:51.686
[FALCO] Don't worry, it's okay.
We're all on the same side now.

21:52.606 --> 21:55.526
[CONNY]
There's not much time. Let's go.

21:56.606 --> 21:58.026
Go where?

22:02.616 --> 22:04.946
To end this and save the world.

22:09.866 --> 22:14.876
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:40.876 --> 23:44.586
[NARRATOR] Strangers become
enemies in the chaos of war.

23:44.676 --> 23:48.766
We learn to hurt, kill,
and despise each other,

23:48.846 --> 23:52.016
but what do we see
through the campfire's flame?

23:52.096 --> 23:54.936
Next episode:
"Night of the End."
